ort. Update your project to ESM or remain on v5.\n- **Node.js compatibility**: Use Node.js 16+ (18+ recommended for ESM features/stability).\n- **Project changes**: Add `\"type\": \"module\"` to `package.json`, replace `require()` with `import`, add file extensions, update tsconfig for TypeScript.\n- **Interoperability**: Node 22+ can `require()` ESM in CJS with a flag, but this is not the long-term solution.\n\nIf you provide more detail about your codebase, I can give you a tailored migration/upgrade path.\n\n**References**:\n- 【3:0†source】\n- 【3:3†source】\n- 【3:5†source】\n- 【3:6†source】\n- 【3:7†source】",
